\item \textbf{6-State EKF}: Fuse inertial + radar measurements
\item \textbf{Coordinate Transform}: Polar$\rightarrow$ENU$\rightarrow$WGS84
\item \textbf{Binary Output}: Georeferenced targets over SPI DMA
