\vspace{2mm}
\textbf{Why TIM2 gets 240\,MHz}: APB1 timer clock is $\times 2$ from the APB prescaler. With a prescaler of 240--1, TIM2 counts at exactly 1\,MHz (1\,$\mu$s per tick).
\end{frame}

% ===== SLIDE 13: Build System =====
